     "A laundromat fits new dryers that vent into the stairwell behind it. The hot, wet air climbs the stairwell to the small computer room on the top floor, water condenses inside the cold metal cases of the machines, and within a year their circuit boards are crusted green with corrosion.",
     "A gym installs a sauna whose vent runs up through its own roof. The parish archive above stays cool and dry, and on Thursdays visitors come to read the old registers.",
